        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We collect, process, transmit, and store personal information in connection with the operation of our business and are subject to a variety of local, state, national and international laws, directives and regulations that apply to the collection, use, retention, protection, security, disclosure, transfer and other processing of personal data in the different jurisdictions in which we operate.",
        "start_character": 78748,
        "end_character": 79143
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-014300",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-014300-fd30bf23b6d50016",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-014300",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We plan to continue to develop our platform to offer our customers the ability to seamlessly address the additional capabilities and features that they demand by customizing their offerings on top of our solutions.",
        "start_character": 62793,
        "end_character": 63007
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-014300",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-014300-fd30bf23b6d50016",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-014300",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We, along with commercialization partners such as MOIA and Holon, expect to sell or deploy Mobileye Drive™-equipped self-driving vehicles to a range of transportation network companies, public transit operators, other mobility service companies and vehicle OEMs which intend to operate a variety of services (e.g., consumer-facing AMaaS, transportation on demand, delivery).",
        "start_character": 67450,
        "end_character": 67824
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-014300",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-014300-fd30bf23b6d50016",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-014300",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "so long as Intel beneficially owns at least 20% of our common stock, we will sell Intel our commercially available products, including EyeQ™ SoCs, for internal use, but not for resale on a standalone or bundled basis;",
        "start_character": 103691,
        "end_character": 103908
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-014300",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-014300-fd30bf23b6d50016",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-014300",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Additionally, we have designed a full set of eyes-off/hands-off solutions at a wide variety of price points and a spectrum of functionalities and ODDs.",
        "start_character": 23347,
        "end_character": 23498
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-014300",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-014300-fd30bf23b6d50016",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-014300",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As a result of our relationship with Intel, we have access to certain technologies that support design and development of our software-defined radar, including Intel’s mmWave technologies.",
        "start_character": 68720,
        "end_character": 68908
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-014300",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-014300-fd30bf23b6d50016",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-014300",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As a result, we will not own most new radar intellectual property, even if developed solely by us.",
        "start_character": 108716,
        "end_character": 108814
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-014300",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-014300-fd30bf23b6d50016",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-014300",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Autonomous driving laws and regulations are expected to continue to evolve in numerous jurisdictions in the United States and foreign countries and may create restrictions on autonomous driving features that we develop.",
        "start_character": 75181,
        "end_character": 75400
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-014300",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-014300-fd30bf23b6d50016",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-014300",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "For example, we have co-developed six EyeQ™ generations, including the EyeQ™6.",
        "start_character": 68217,
        "end_character": 68295
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-014300",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-014300-fd30bf23b6d50016",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-014300",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In certain countries in which we operate, we are subject to, and comply with, local labor law requirements, which may automatically make our employees subject to industry-wide collective bargaining agreements.",
        "start_character": 95996,
        "end_character": 96205
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-014300",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-014300-fd30bf23b6d50016",
